@page "/"

<PageTitle>Frédéric Larue — Accueil</PageTitle>

@* The gallery is the whole design here. The heading is visually hidden rather
   than absent: without it this page has no title text at all, which leaves
   FocusOnNavigate (App.razor) with nothing to focus and search engines with
   nothing to index on the site's entry point. *@
<h1 class="visually-hidden">Frédéric Larue — développeur C# / .NET</h1>

<div class="ImageCardGrid">
    <ImageCard Src="images/about me.jpg" Caption="À propos" Href="/AboutMe" />
    <ImageCard Src="images/code.jpg" Caption="CV" Href="/Cv" />
    <ImageCard Src="images/game.jpg" Caption="Jeu" Href="/Game" />
</div>
